    {
      "code": "<meta content=\"0.0050; URL=https://cktelefoonopstellenconfiguraties.nl/klanten/inloggen\" http-equiv=refresh>",
      "code_explain": "Meta refresh redirect is a classic obfuscation technique used to bounce users to a phishing login page while evading naive URL scanners. The target path '/klanten/inloggen' (customers/login) is a credential-harvesting pattern.",
      "tag": "CREDENTIAL_HARVESTING"
    },
    {
      "code": "U wordt nu doorverwezen naar onze secure website...",
