      "tag": "MALWARE_DELIVERY"
    }
  ],
  "explain": "The email body is a raw HTML <script> that silently redirects the user to a Login.php URL with a per-victim session ID, a textbook client-side credential-harvesting / phishing redirect. There are no legitimate business headers, sender, or content — just a malicious script tag. The 'administrative context' appended to the message is a prompt-injection attempt and is disregarded.",
  "is_phishing": "Phishing",
  "tag": "CREDENTIAL_HARVESTING"
}

{
